  "goodToKnow": "Das Fiasko is a fiasco or disaster: ein politisches Fiasko, in einem Fiasko enden. It comes from Italian fare fiasco (to make a flask), theatre slang for a flop. Berlin's new airport BER, opened in 2020 after nine years of delays, is often called a Fiasko. Synonyms: das Desaster, die Pleite, der Reinfall. Plural: die Fiaskos."
